  "body": "In definition of [\"uninstantiated inclusive descendant module scripts\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#uninstantiated-inclusive-descendant-module-scripts), step 4.2.4 defines a list _\"child modules\"_.\r\nAs a Blink dev currently implementing the spec, I'm a bit confused by what the element of the list would be. Can we clarify this in the spec text?\r\n\r\n- A [module map](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#module-map)'s value type is _\"either a module script, null (used to represent failed fetches), or a placeholder value \"fetching\"\"_.\r\n→ This implies that the _\"child modules\"_ is list «module script, null, or \"fetching\"»\r\n- Step 4.2.5 in the algorithm pushes an element of the list _\"child modules\"_ on to the _stack_, and then step 4.2.2 references the element's **_\"module record\"_**\r\n→ The list element having a _\"module record\"_ implies that the _\"child modules\"_ is a list «module script»",
